.TH WERKMEISTER-STANDARDS 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-standards \- Validate the configured standards tree (structural regression gate)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister standards\fR <action>
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Checks the configured standards tree for structural errors and exits 1 on any, so a malformed standards edit fails loudly instead of silently dropping out. It also checks each repo's own tree (\fB<repo>/.werkmeister/standards/\fR, for every main checkout under \fBpaths.repos_root\fR) and fails when a repo module reuses a global module's \fBdomain\fR. It prints the tree's path. Unlike \fBwerkmeister skills check\fR, it is not tied to a workspace.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
werkmeister standards check
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
